      "created": 1791104859325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements:\n\n-Support inserting words into internal dictionary\n-Return suggestions when a user types a prefix.\n-Suggestions should be ranked based on a configurable strategy (alpha-\nbetical or frequency-based).\n-The number of suggestions returned should be configurable.\n-Frequency count is incremented each time a word is added.\n-Words and prefixes are treated case insensitively.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements:\n\n-Support inserting words into internal dictionary\n-Return suggestions when a user types a prefix.\n-Suggestions should be ranked based on a configurable strategy (alpha-betical or frequency-based).\n-The number of suggestions returned should be configurable.\n-Frequency count is incremented each time a word is added.\n-Words and prefixes are treated case insensitively.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
