      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- WordRepository: stores words,frequencies\n - IngestionService: service that is responsible for inserting user inputs into the system as words\n- SuggestionService: service that is responmsible for retrieving suggestions for a prefix\n- RankingStrategy: ranking strategy contract that every ranking algorithm follows\n- AlphabeticalRankingStrategy: Concrete Implementation to sort alphabetically\n- FrequencyBasedRankingStrategy: Concrete implementation to sort based on frequency\n- SearchAutoCompleteSystem: User facing facade that exposes meaningful operations and hide\ncomplexity",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- WordRepository: stores words,frequencies\n - IngestionService: service that is responsible for inserting user inputs into the system as words\n- SuggestionService: service that is responmsible for retrieving suggestions for a prefix\n- RankingStrategy: ranking strategy contract that every ranking algorithm follows\n- AlphabeticalRankingStrategy: Concrete Implementation to sort alphabetically\n- FrequencyBasedRankingStrategy: Concrete implementation to sort based on frequency\n- SearchAutoCompleteSystem: User facing facade that exposes meaningful operations and hide complexity",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
